<section class="section engineering-section" id="systems">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="engineering-heading">
            <div><span class="section-badge">ENGINEERING PRACTICE</span><h2 class="section-title">Technical depth is<br /><span class="text-gradient">the product.</span></h2></div>
            <p>We work from the inside out: clarify constraints, make the system legible, then create the path from code to dependable operation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="engineering-grid">
            <article><span>01 / ARCHITECTURE</span><h3>Software architecture</h3><p>Clear domains, dependable interfaces, and systems designed for change.</p><small>Service design · API boundaries · technical discovery</small></article>
            <article><span>02 / BACKEND</span><h3>Backend systems</h3><p>Application cores where data, workflows, and business rules stay explicit.</p><small>Distributed services · identity · async processing</small></article>
            <article><span>03 / PLATFORM</span><h3>Cloud &amp; delivery</h3><p>Infrastructure that makes delivery repeatable and runtime behavior visible.</p><small>Containers · Kubernetes · CI/CD · networking</small></article>
            <article><span>04 / SIGNAL</span><h3>Data &amp; AI infrastructure</h3><p>Practical systems for moving, governing, and using data and model capabilities.</p><small>Pipelines · observability · model gateways</small></article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .engineering-section { background: #0c0c0f; border-bottom: 1px solid #27272a; }
    .engineering-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .7fr; gap: 80px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 54px; }
    .engineering-heading h2 { margin-top: 20px; }
    .engineering-heading > p { margin: 0; color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; }
    .engineering-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid #3f3f46; border-left: 1px solid #27272a; }
    .engineering-grid article { min-height: 330px; padding: 25px; border-right: 1px solid #27272a; border-bottom: 1px solid #27272a; transition: background .25s ease; }
    .engineering-grid article:hover { background: #151519; }
    .engineering-grid article > span, .engineering-grid small { color: #71717a; font: 10px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .07em; }
    .engineering-grid h3 { margin: 76px 0 12px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .engineering-grid p { color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .engineering-grid small { display: block; line-height: 1.75; }

    @media(max-width:1000px){
        .engineering-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
        .engineering-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
    @media(max-width:760px){
        .engineering-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .engineering-grid article { min-height: 0; }
        .engineering-grid h3 { margin-top: 44px; }
    }
</style>
